OL,3,GNEWSALocal leaders reject police
OL,4,A'mega-force' plans
OL,5,
OL,6,FSenior politicians across North
OL,7,FYorkshire have spoken of their
OL,8,Fopposition to proposals for so-called
OL,9,Fpolice "mega-forces".
OL,11,FSir Mark Rowley, Britain's most senior
OL,12,Fpolice officer, recently said policing
OL,13,Fwas "heading for failure" without
OL,14,Fchange and has proposed between eight
OL,15,Fand 10 regional forces should be
OL,16,Festablished.
OL,23,APub: 16-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,388,380,200,160,0,100
