OL,3,GNEWSALocal leaders reject police
OL,4,A'mega-force' plans
OL,5,
OL,6,FBut Jo Coles, York and North
OL,7,FYorkshire's Labour deputy mayor, warned
OL,8,Fbigger forces would jeopardise links
OL,9,Fbetween officers and their communities,
OL,10,Fadding that merging forces would prove
OL,11,Fa "distraction" and would "take
OL,12,Fresources from the front line".
OL,14,FA Home Office spokesperson said the
OL,15,Fcurrent model of policing "has not
OL,16,Fchanged since the 1960s and is no
OL,17,Flonger fit for purpose".
OL,23,APub: 16-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
